   <narrative xml:lang="EN">KIR Children at risk</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">KIR Utsatta barn</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will continue its support to develop methods for work with children at risk and children with disabilities in Kyrgyzstan. Social workers will be trained as well as other categories of staff involved such as local authorities, police, schools and NGOs. Two pilots will be developed as methodological centres: Sokuluk for children at risk and Maksat for children with disabilities.</narrative>
  </description>
